## 结构体中的生命周期

结构体持有引用时必须标注生命周期，确保结构体不会比引用的数据活得更久。

```rust
struct Excerpt<'a> {
    text: &'a str,
}

impl<'a> Excerpt<'a> {
    fn level(&self) -> i32 {
        3
    }

    fn announce(&self, announcement: &str) -> &str {
        println!("请注意: {}", announcement);
        self.text
    }
}

fn main() {
    let novel = String::from("在很久很久以前。有一个勇敢的骑士...");
    let first_sentence = novel.split('。').next().unwrap();
    let excerpt = Excerpt { text: first_sentence };
    println!("摘录: {}", excerpt.text);
}
```

